<ul class="ss-listview ss-utility-box" data-role="listview" data-inset="true" data-theme="a" id="SelfService-1782302045308-disclaimerContent">
	<li data-role="list-divider" data-theme="a" style="text-align: center;">Disclaimer Content</li>
	<li class="ss-listview-internal" style="background: none; border: none;">
		<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
<i><span style="background-color:white;font-size:14pt;color:#333333;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">This online database is provided by the Durham County Register of Deeds office, solely for the convenience of its public users. While every effort is made to ensure that this information is accurate and current, the certified record, including historical indexes can be found on site.</span></i>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
<i><span style="background-color:white;font-size:14pt;color:#333333;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll"> </span></i>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
<b><span style="font-size:12pt">Upon creating an online profile <a href="https://rodweb.dconc.gov/web/user/register">here</a></span><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;font-size:10pt;color:#333333">, </span><span style="font-size:12pt;color:#333333">users are users are able to search birth, death and marriage records online and print uncertified copies </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:39pt;line-height:normal;text-indent:-0.25in;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
 

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-size:12pt">All real estate documents are accessible online with the following exceptions. </span></b>

</p>

<ul><li>
<b>Historical Record</b>

</li><li>
<b>Condo Books</b>

</li><li>
<b>Corporate Books</b>

</li><li>
<b>Mortgage Books</b>

</li><li>
<b>Plat Books</b>

</li></ul>
<p>
 

</p>

<p>
<b><span style="font-size:12pt">When conducting a search for historic plats or maps be advised that some of the historic plat books numbered 1-31 may be separated into “A” or “B” books. When searching, the letter “A” or “B” should be added to the following books:</span></b>

</p>

<p>
<b><span style="font-size:12pt"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-left:0in;line-height:106%">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">Plat Books:</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">1A, 1B             Book 1A starts with page 1 and ends with page 130; 1B starts with page 131 and ends with page 261</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt"> </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">3A, 3B             Book 3A starts with page 1 and ends with page 95; 3B starts with page 96 and ends with page 195</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt"> </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">5A, 5B             Book 5A starts with page 1 and ends with page 100; 5B starts with page 101 and ends with page 195</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt"> </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">6A, 6B             Book 6A starts with page 1 and ends with page 106; 6B starts with page 107 and ends with page 208</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt"> </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">18A                 All entries for this book are under 18A, there is no Book 18B</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">                                                                                                 </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">28A, 28B         Book 28A starts with page 1 and ends with page 56;   28B starts with page 57 and ends with page 111</span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt"> </span><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif"> </span></b>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , serif;color:#ff0000;font-size:12pt">31A, 32B         Book 31A starts with page 1 and ends with page 56;   31B starts with page 57 and ends with page 112</span></b><span style="font-size:12pt"> </span>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-left:0in;line-height:106%">
<b><span style="font-size:12pt"> </span></b><span style="font-size:12pt"> </span>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
<i><span style="font-size:14pt">In some rare instances, images may be temporarily unavailable online while system backups are in progress. The Registrar will make every effort to provide public notice during these occasions. Please note, all N.C. General Statutes related to both the temporary and permanent indexes will be adhered to during these infrequent periods</span><span style="font-size:12pt">.</span></i>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
<i><span style="font-size:12pt"> </span></i>

</p>

<p style="margin-top:0.1in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0.1in;margin-left:0in;line-height:normal;background-color:white;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll">
 

</p>


