				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel showing" style="" id="tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabBtnab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_0" tabindex="-1">

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor19825227-2e25-4cbe-bc91-820f97e44c4a" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <ul><li><strong>Plans Review Requirements:</strong> The minimum documents and plans information necessary for permit issuance.</li><li><strong>Plot Plans: </strong>A dimensioned plan view depiction of the project parcel with all existing and proposed elements.</li><li><strong>Small Project Plan Review:</strong> All residential projects not classified as new residential units.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Site Plan Review Items: </strong>Checklist of property details reviewed by Building &amp; Safety for Planning &amp; Development Site Plan approval.</li></ul>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + '19825227-2e25-4cbe-bc91-820f97e44c4a'));
	});
</script>
</div>
				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs " role="tablist" aria-hidden="True.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" style='display: none;'>
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_1" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrowab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_1" role="tab" aria-controls="tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="1" data-tabname="Permits" contenteditable="false">Permits</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabBtnab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_1" tabindex="-1">

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor493db868-907c-4b0b-92ad-46732505ff13" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <ul><li><strong>Building Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Required for any project that includes load bearing work or any project exceeding $40K in market value.</li><li><strong>Electrical Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Required for installing, repairing, or altering electrical wiring or equipment (excluding minor fixture replacements in one/two-family homes).</li><li><strong>Mechanical Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Required for installing or ugrading heating, air conditioning, and ventilation systems.</li><li><strong>Plumbing Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Required for new construction, additions, alterations, replacements, all private utilities (Sewer &amp; Water Services), new backflow installs for buildings and irrigation systems. A backflow permit is also required from Durham&apos;s Cross Connection Control Department for any backflow install.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong>Multi-Trade Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Combines multiple trades into a single permit for coordinated projects.</li><li><strong>Temporary Power Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Allows temporary electrical service for construction or events. Can only be applied if a Building permit is issued.</li><li><strong>Stocking Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Applies to commercial projects only-for stocking of items used to conduct business prior to issuance of the Certificate of Compliance.</li><li><strong>Partial Occupancy Permit:&nbsp;</strong>Applies to commercial projects only-for phased occupancy approvals prior to the Certificate of Compliance.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li></ul>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + '493db868-907c-4b0b-92ad-46732505ff13'));
	});
</script>
</div>
				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs " role="tablist" aria-hidden="True.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" style='display: none;'>
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_2" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrowab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_2" role="tab" aria-controls="tabab7d7bf5-62e0-4e8e-a9bf-72cdd9c05339_2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="2" data-tabname="Inspections" contenteditable="false">Inspections</span></a>
</li>
