<main id="contentArea" class="layoutContainer">
    <div id="heroZone">
        <div class="titleArea siteBounds"><h1>Clerk of Superior Court</h1></div>
        <div class="Freeform FeatureImage New100 HeroZone TitanBlock"><p><img alt="Gavel Image" height="3648" loading="lazy" src="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court1/Images/gavel-and-pad.jpg" width="5472" /></p>
</div>
    </div>
    
    <div id="topZone">
        
        <div class="TitanStripe StripeIntro"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="Freeform IconBorder Flex33 New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" src="/Images/Icons/Team.png" /></p>

<h2>What we do</h2>
</div><div class="Freeform VerticalCenter Flex66 New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p><!--StartFragment --></p>

<p>The Clerk of the Superior Court, elected to a four-year term, is responsible for all administrative, clerical, and record-keeping functions of the District and Superior Courts. As the Judge of Probate, the Clerk has exclusive original jurisdiction over:</p>

<ul>
	<li>matters regarding the probate of wills</li>
	<li>administration of estates in the county</li>
	<li>adoptions</li>
	<li>incompetency and guardianship proceedings&nbsp;</li>
	<li>partitions of real property</li>
	<li>name changes</li>
	<li>real estate foreclosures</li>
	<li>petitions for surplus funds</li>
</ul>

<p>It is the mission of the Durham County Clerk of Superior Court to provide ethical and efficient administrative and case management support to the Courts and to serve the public through professionally-trained, diverse, and customer-focused staff. We are dedicated to facilitating the impartial administration of justice and equal access to the Courts&#39; resources. We strive to ensure that everyone within our organization and those who we serve are treated with integrity, fairness, and respect.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
</div></div></div><div class="TitanStripe StripeDefaultNoTopPadding"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="Freeform New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><h2 style="text-align:center">Our Departments &amp; services</h2>
</div><div class="Aggregation SubService FilterGrid ThreeCard New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><div class="ResultsListing AggregationResults" aria-live="polite" xmlns:msxsl="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:xslt"><div id="F537_Waiting" class="loading">Please wait while we gather your results.</div><div id="F537_ResultsDiv" class="AggregationResults"><div class="data" id="F537_skiptoResults"><div class="OneCol"><div class="item image altRow"><a class="teaserImage" title="Civil" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Civil"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/mace.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Civil</h4><p class="teaser">Divorces; Small Claims; District and Superior Court</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Civil" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Civil">Read More</a></p></div></div><div class="item image"><a class="teaserImage" title="Criminal &amp; Traffic" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Criminal-and-Traffic"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/traffic-light.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Criminal & Traffic</h4><p class="teaser">Traffic Citations; Court Appearances; Record Checks</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Criminal &amp; Traffic" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Criminal-and-Traffic">Read More</a></p></div></div><div class="item image altRow"><a class="teaserImage" title="Estates" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Estates"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/government.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Estates</h4><p class="teaser">Probate; Guardian Appointment</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Estates" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Estates">Read More</a></p></div></div><div class="item image"><a class="teaserImage" title="Jury Duty" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Jury-Duty"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/jury.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Jury Duty</h4><p class="teaser">Detailed information about Jury Duty in Durham County</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Jury Duty" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Jury-Duty">Read More</a></p></div></div><div class="item image altRow"><a class="teaserImage" title="Language Access" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Court-Services/Language-Access"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/world.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Language Access</h4><p class="teaser">Access to the Courts in multiple languages</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Language Access" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Court-Services/Language-Access">Read More</a></p></div></div><div class="item image"><a class="teaserImage" title="Special Proceedings" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Special-Proceedings"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="/Images/Icons/legal-document.png" class="lazy animate-in"></a><div class="otherStuff"><!--content spacer--><h4 role="presentation">Special Proceedings</h4><p class="teaser">Incompetency; Name Changes; Adoptions; Foreclosures</p><p class="linkText"><a aria-label="Read More about Special Proceedings" href="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court/Special-Proceedings">Read More</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><script type='text/javascript'>NWS.Modules.LoadResources(["/Views/Display/Blocks/Support/NWS.FormEditorSupport.js","/Views/Display/Blocks/Support/NWS.FilterSupport.js","/scripts/NWS.HistoryExtensions.js"], [{"func":"NWS.Block.Aggregation.ResetFieldsetState","args":[537]}], []);</script></div></div></div><div class="TitanStripe StripeImageStripeSplitCircle"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="Freeform Flex50 LinkList SplitText New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><h2>Enterprise Justice&nbsp;</h2>

<ul>
	<li><a href="https://northcarolina.tylertech.cloud/SRL/SRL" linktype="3" target="_self">eCourts Guide &amp; File</a>

	<ul>
		<li>Guide &amp; File is a free online service to help users prepare court documents for certain case types.&nbsp;</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><a href="https://efilenc.tylertech.cloud/" linktype="3" target="_self">File &amp; Serve</a>
	<ul>
		<li>Register for an individual or law firm account and start filing your court documents here.&nbsp;</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><a href="https://portal-nc.tylertech.cloud/Portal/" linktype="3" target="_self">Portal</a>
	<ul>
		<li>View court dates, hearings, case info, records, judgments, and documents.&nbsp;Pay fines and fees for criminal cases &amp; infractions.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><a href="https://portal-nc.tylertech.cloud/Portal/" linktype="3" target="_self">Court Date Reminders</a>
	<ul>
		<li>You can sign up for text or email notifications of changes to court dates on criminal and infraction cases.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
</div><div class="Freeform Flex50 SplitImage VerticalCenter New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p style="text-align:center"><img alt="Durham County Bull" height="3648" loading="lazy" src="/Clerk-of-the-Superior-Court1/Images/pexels-ekaterina-bolovtsova-6077797.jpg" width="5472" /></p>
</div></div></div><div class="TitanStripe StripeWideSimpleCard"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="Freeform Flex33 New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/Images/Aminah-M.-Thompson.png" /></p>
